>> title: Lemon Bars
>> category: Bars & Brownies
>> tags: lemon, shortbread, dessert, oven
>> servings: 9
>> time: 1 hr
>> step.4: press and bake at 350°F for 20 min
>> step.7: bake 325°F (165°C) 25 min

Preheat the #oven{} to 350°F (175°C).

Line an #8x8-in pan{} with parchment.

Rub @cold unsalted butter{1/2%cup}(115 g) into @all-purpose flour{1%cup}(130 g), @powdered sugar{1/4%cup}(30 g), @table salt{1/4%tsp}(1.5 g).

Press @&(~1)shortbread crumbs{} into the pan and bake at 350°F for ~{20%min}.

Whisk @eggs{2%large}(100 g), @granulated sugar{3/4%cup}(150 g), @all-purpose flour{2%Tbs}(16 g), @lemon juice{1/3%cup}(80 mL), @lemon zest{1%Tbs} until smooth.

Pour @&(~1)lemon filling{} over @&(~2)hot crust{}.

Lower the #oven{} to 325°F (165°C) and bake @&(~1)bars{} for ~{25%min}.
